 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Nice of them. A welcome mat, easy to wipe feet on, helps a lot. And some nice big towels by the showers and sink. A few snacks are nice, but keep them simple and free of salt. Water is always great, especially if it includes natural cleansers in the bathroom. A note is friendly without being nosy. Says guest room Wi Fi password here, and leave it on the bathroom mirror. If you have room, sure. A small vase of fresh cut paper whites always makes a room look and smell lovely.",
